Table 12: Evidence-based Fusion prompt. The evidence in the evidence pool will be organized according to the format shown in the Evidence Format.{INST} will be replaced by Instruction, {DEMO} will be replaced by 3-shot demonstrations, {E} will be replaced by evidence, and {Q} will be replaced by question.

